><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\">▾</span><i class=\"tr-box on\"></i><span class=\"tr-label\">页面权限</span></div><div class=\"tr-children\"><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\"></span><i class=\"tr-box on\"></i><span class=\"tr-label\">查看</span></div><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\"></span><i class=\"tr-box\"></i><span class=\"tr-label\">编辑</span></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"tr-demo\"><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\">▾</span><i class=\"tr-box on\"></i><span class=\"tr-label\">Page permissions</span></div><div class=\"tr-children\"><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\"></span><i class=\"tr-box on\"></i><span class=\"tr-label\">View</span></div><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\"></span><i class=\"tr-box\"></i><span class=\"tr-label\">Edit</span></div></div></div>","when":"要在层级里批量选择，比如配权限","when_en":"To select items by hierarchy, such as when assigning permissions"},{"cn":"带连接线","en":"ShowLine","demo":"<div class=\"tr-demo tr-line\"><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\">▾</span><span class=\"tr-label\">设计部</span></div><div class=\"tr-children\"><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\">▸</span><span class=\"tr-label\">UI 组</span></div><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\">▸</span><span class=\"tr-label\">用研组</span></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"tr-demo tr-line\"><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\">▾</span><span class=\"tr-label\">Design Department</span></div><div class=\"tr-children\"><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\">▸</span><span class=\"tr-label\">UI Group</span></div><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\">▸</span><span class=\"tr-label\">User Research Group</span></div></div></div>","when":"需要加强父子节点归属辨识时","when_en":"When parent-child relationships need to be easier to scan"},{"cn":"目录树","en":"Directory","demo":"<div class=\"tr-demo\"><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\">▾</span><span class=\"tr-label\">📁 设计资源</span></div><div class=\"tr-children\"><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\"></span><span class=\"tr-label\">📄 首页.sketch</span></div><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\"></span><span class=\"tr-label\">📄 图标.sketch</span></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"tr-demo\"><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\">▾</span><span class=\"tr-label\">📁 Design resources</span></div><div class=\"tr-children\"><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\"></span><span class=\"tr-label\">📄 Home.sketch</span></div><div class=\"tr-node\"><span class=\"tr-arrow\"></span><span class=\"tr-label\">📄 icon.sketch</span></div></div></div>","when":"展示文件目录，配文件夹图标更直观","when_en":"Use folder icons to make a file hierarchy easier to scan"}],"use":[{"t":"数据<b>天生有层级</b>：文件夹、分类、菜单","m":"tree-folder"},{"t":"存在<b>多层父子关系</b>，需要逐级展开查看","m":"tree-deep"},{"t":"<b>组织架构</b>选人：公司 → 部门 → 成员","m":"tree-org"},{"t":"在层级里<b>批量勾选</b>：权限、可见范围配置","m":"tree-check"}],"dont":[{"t":"层级较浅且只需沿单一路径选择时，使用 {c:cascader} 更直接","m":"sel-cascader","bad":true},{"t":"单层数据没有父子关系时，应使用 {c:list}","m":"tree-flat","bad":true},{"t":"窄屏展示深层树会让多级缩进持续压缩内容，可改用分步选择","m":"tree-narrow","bad":true},{"t":"默认<b>全部展开</b>，节点过多会削弱层级辨识","m":"tree-allopen","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"项目文件浏览器要展示文件夹、子文件夹和文件，用户主要是逐层查看位置，不需要提交选择结果。怎样组织？","options":[{"id":"expandable-hierarchy-tree","label":"使用可展开的树形控件，保留父子缩进和每层展开状态","feedback":"文件本身具有多层父子关系，树能在同一区域里逐级浏览并保持当前位置。","correct":true},{"id":"flat-file-list","label":"把所有文件和文件夹放进一个列表，只按名称排序","feedback":"扁平排序会丢失文件属于哪个目录，重名文件和深层位置都难以判断。","correct":false},{"id":"submit-cascader","label":"每次用级联选择器选中一条路径，然后提交后才能查看内容","feedback":"级联选择适合沿单一路径选值，当前任务需要持续展开和比较同级节点，而不是提交选择。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A project browser shows folders, nested folders, and files. Users mainly browse location by level and do not submit a selection. How should it be organized?","options":[{"id":"expandable-hierarchy-tree","label":"Use an expandable tree with parent-child indentation and persistent expansion state","feedback":"Files naturally form a multi-level hierarchy, and a tree supports gradual browsing while preserving location.","correct":true},{"id":"flat-file-list","label":"Put every file and folder in one list sorted only by name","feedback":"Flattening removes directory membership, making duplicate names and deep locations difficult to understand.","correct":false},{"id":"submit-cascader","label":"Choose one path in a cascader and submit before its contents can be viewed","feedback":"A cascader fits selecting one path. This task needs persistent expansion and sibling comparison rather than submission.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把项目文件区做成树形浏览：文件夹可展开收起，文件不可展开，缩进和图标要能区分层级，并保留当前展开状态。测试深层目录、同名文件、键盘导航和窄屏缩进。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Build the project browser as a tree: folders expand and collapse, files do not, indentation and icons expose levels, and expansion state persists. Test deep nesting, duplicate names, keyboard navigation, and narrow-screen indentation."}},"references":[{"title":"Tree View 树视图模式","source":"WAI-ARIA APG","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/treeview/","title_en":"Tree View Pattern"}],"scenes":["文件目录浏览","组织架构选人","权限配置勾选","商品分类管理"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Folder browser","m":"tree-folder"},{"t":"Organization chart","m":"tree-deep"},{"t":"Nested category list","m":"tree-org"},{"t":"Any data with meaningful parent-child levels","m":"tree-check"}],"dont":[{"t":"Turn a simple flat list into a tree","m":"sel-cascader","bad":true},{"t":"Open a very large tree without search or lazy loading","m":"tree-flat","bad":true},{"t":"Hide the current selection when branches collapse","m":"tree-narrow","bad":true},{"t":"Leave parent-child selection behavior unexplained","m":"tree-allopen","bad":true}],"scenes":["File browser","Department tree","Category manager","Permission editor"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;b